# Goose CLI Agent Hints — Portfolio Studio CMS

# Environment
PROJECT_ROOT="c:\xampp\htdocs\portfolio"
PHP_BIN="php"
COMPOSER_BIN="composer"
NODE_BIN="node"
NPM_BIN="npm"

# Key Commands
build: npm run build
test: php artisan test
serve: php artisan serve
cache_clear: php artisan optimize:clear

# Guidelines
- All database content is dynamic. Do not insert static arrays into views.
- Application port is strictly controlled via SERVER_PORT in .env.
- Consult .agents/ directory for complete skill definitions and personas.
